cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "LLM Capacity Planner: GPU memory and concurrency calculator for vLLM and SGLang"
abstract: >-
  A command-line GPU sizing tool for LLM inference. For a Hugging Face model, it computes the memory the model needs
  on vLLM or SGLang (weights and KV cache), which NVIDIA GPUs fit it, how many concurrent users they serve and how
  many tokens per second each user gets, from the model's metadata and a speed model calibrated on measured runs and
  public benchmarks.
authors:
